Package: kmod-wireguard
Version: 5.15.173-1
Depends: kernel (=5.15.173-1-f818ed7867526c1ef40764695e0f2bee), kmod-crypto-lib-chacha20poly1305, kmod-crypto-lib-curve25519, kmod-udptunnel4, kmod-udptunnel6
